Z||000011||bHooper||03-19-2000||07:51 AM||||A really amazing thing happened to me at Advanced Auto, yesterday... the guy behind the counter didnt snear or grunt, when i told him Fiero GT!  in fact, he said, "those are pretty cars"!!!  They dont know how close they were to haveing to call a ambulance... I almost went into shock when he said that!||||reg||1
