Z||000015||bHooper||03-21-2000||05:34 PM||||I got my tranny today!!!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>WOOHOO!!!!!!!!!!!<P>Smiles all around!!!<P>Now for the difficult part... reassembling a puzzle that I didn't take apart  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000016||bHooper||04-04-2000||10:27 PM||||its tuesday nite, and we finally finished what we set out to do saturday morning... drop the cradle!  <P>honestly, most of saturday was spent looking for a wrench for the fuel lines, and all of sunday, a hour on monday and 2 hours tonight were spent trying to either free or cut a stubborn cradle bolt... but alas <B>SUCCESS!!!</B><P>i am hopeing to install the tranny this weekend and get the sucker back in the car by the end of april.  <P>why so long?<P>funds have run low   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>and i need to replace the mounts, the cradle bushings, and the battery support/tray before i put the engine back in.<P>but for now... i am all smiles    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>just hope the body doesnt come tumbling down b4 then    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Thanks again to <B>ALL</B> who have offered advice, and moral support to get me through this!  <P>I will be calling for more  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>hoop <P><p>[This message has been edited by bHooper (edited 04-04-2000).]||||reg||1
